        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWNEWCOM, Newport Lever with Newport Rose Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRope detailing for door hardware has long been a favorite for its classic elegance. The Newport Single Cylinder Entryset made by Grandeur Hardware is a front-runner in traditional style. A single cylinder entryset, it is both good looking, and offers high security. The Newport Lever with Newport Rose Combo is available in a wide array of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWNEWCOM Single Cylinder Newport Entryset:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Rosette with Newport Lever and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Lever Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Newport Lever Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWNEWCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport Entryset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
